* American Lead C+ preamp, stage 1 of 3: the guitar and its pickup / cable networks, V1A, the tone stack, volume 1 and V1B up to its coupling capacitor and the node nr that feeds both channels.
* Stage 2 continues from nr. Each stage carries the supply decoupling it needs (R86 / C87 on the D+ node) and dummy loads for the currents of the others, so the DC points are those of the
* single netlist (kept as the reference of sas_split_check). Units: k M, m u n p. Node "0" is ground. See engine/include/sas/netlist.h for the format.

V VRAIL x 100 450
R R86 x dp 1k
C C87 dp 0 30u
R Rdummy_dp dp 0 193k
I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p
R R1 in 0 1M
T V1A in p1 k1 12AX7
R R4 dp p1 150k
R R2 k1 0 1.5k
C C1 k1 0 0.47u
C C2 k1 c2n 22u
R R3 c2n 0 15k
R SW_SHIFT c2n 0 1e12
C C5 p1 t0 250p
C C6 p1 xs 750p
R R6 xs t0 10M
R SW_TSHIFT xs t0 1e12
R R5 p1 sl 100k
R VR3T t0 w3 1
R VR3B w3 b1 1
C C4 sl b1 0.1u
R VR5 b1 m1 125k
C C3 sl m1 0.047u
R VR4 m1 0 5k
R R_OPT w3 vt 100k
R VR1T vt w 1
R VR1B w 0 1
C C_BR vt cb 180p
R SW_BR cb w 1e12
T V1B w p1b k1b 12AX7
R R8 dp p1b 100k
R R7 k1b 0 1.5k
C C13 k1b 0 22u
C C7 p1b nr 0.1u
R R9 nr 0 100k
R Rdummy_nr nr 0 3.98M
